---
title: Event Capsule Lifecycle and Retention
---
flowchart TB
    classDef full fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1e40af,stroke-width:2px
    classDef decimated fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#92400e,stroke-width:2px
    classDef tokens fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#166534,stroke-width:2px
    classDef forever fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#6b21a8,stroke-width:3px

    capture[Event captured]

    subgraph Full["FULL FIDELITY · ~50 MB · default 1 year"]
        direction LR
        f1[Raw samples 256 ksps]:::full
        f2[Token stream]:::full
        f3[Parse tree]:::full
        f4[Embeddings]:::full
        f5[Voice tags + transcripts]:::full
        f6[Labels + history]:::full
        f1 ~~~ f2 ~~~ f3 ~~~ f4 ~~~ f5 ~~~ f6
    end

    subgraph Decimated["DECIMATED · ~7 MB · default 5 years"]
        direction LR
        d1[Decimated samples 16 ksps]:::decimated
        d2[Token stream]:::decimated
        d3[Parse tree]:::decimated
        d4[Embeddings]:::decimated
        d5[Voice tags + transcripts]:::decimated
        d6[Labels + history]:::decimated
        d1 ~~~ d2 ~~~ d3 ~~~ d4 ~~~ d5 ~~~ d6
    end

    subgraph TokensOnly["TOKENS+LABELS · ~100 KB · forever"]
        direction LR
        t2[Token stream]:::tokens
        t4[Embeddings]:::tokens
        t6[Labels + history]:::tokens
        t7[Provenance back to capture]:::forever
        t2 ~~~ t4 ~~~ t6 ~~~ t7
    end

    transition1[Decimation job<br/>anti-alias + lowpass<br/>preserve manifest history]
    transition2[Tokens-only transition<br/>preserve embeddings<br/>preserve labels]

    legalhold{Legal<br/>hold?}:::full
    override[Override: indefinite full fidelity]:::full

    capture --> Full
    Full --> legalhold
    legalhold -->|yes| override
    legalhold -->|no, age > 1yr| transition1
    transition1 --> Decimated
    Decimated -->|age > 5yr| transition2
    transition2 --> TokensOnly

    note1["💡 Retention policy is per-site
    configurable, with overrides
    by event class and novelty score"]

    note2["⚠ Anti-alias filter applied
    BEFORE decimation. Naive
    downsampling aliases HF
    transients into the kept band."]
